{"The order mixin passes $val directly to -webkit-box-ordinal-group, but this old flexbox property is 1-indexed while the standard order property is 0-indexed, causing inconsistent ordering behavior between old WebKit browsers and modern browsers. The correct mapping should be -webkit-box-ordinal-group: $val + 1 (and same for -moz-box-ordinal-group)": 0.9201040267944336, "The @include order(2) on .extra-info-wrapper has no effect because .extra-info-wrapper is not a direct child of the flex container .contents - it is wrapped inside an Ember component div for header-extra-info, and the CSS order property only works on direct children of a flex container": 0.339945524930954}